{"version":1,"content":"\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261028_hkcourtnews_dog_Cruelty_to_animals-1024x538.jpg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p><strong>一隻幼犬今年5月被遺棄在旺角黑布街104號後巷，28歲女子被控一項「殘酷對待動物」罪，案件今（28日）在西九龍裁判法院首度提堂。案件押後至11月11日，其間索取兩份精神科報告，以檢視被告是否適合答辯，被告須還柙小欖精神病治療中心。</strong></p>\n<p>\n<p><a href=\"https://linktr.ee/hkcourtnews\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">訂閱《庭刊》</a></p>\n</p>\n<p>被告陳凱晴（28歲，無業）被控於今年5月9日，在旺角黑布街104號利豐大廈後巷殘酷地惡待一隻幼犬，導致該幼犬受到不必要的痛苦。</p>\n<p>法院：西九龍裁判法院<br/>被告：陳凱晴<br/>控罪：殘酷對待動物<br/>案件編號：WKCC5134/2026</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://qr.payme.hsbc.com.hk/2/QrndvPxDgEi2MhNiNPz4b8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"916\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9CHKCourtNews_PayMe_QR_code.png\" width=\"716\"/></a></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/hkcourtnews_Octopus_QRcode_Payment_v4.png\" width=\"1080\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>如欲接收每日報道整合，請在訊息欄內填寫電郵地址</strong></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T12:01:19.251032+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":257,"images":3,"source":"法庭線","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T11:35:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T15:55:32.462566+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T11:58:21.749357+00:00","content_hash":"54f4cff697da3b90e31547af55afc087dbdde6add6675e6288b4aa6425637ce0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}